"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:'docs-Calibri';font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;\">38. I listen attentively to music for ___ per day.<\/span>","DataExportTag":"Q40.GMSI","QuestionID":"QID113"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID114","SecondaryAttribute":"39. The instrument I play best (including voice) is","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:'docs-Calibri';font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;\">39. The instrument I play best (including voice) is <br><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"39. The instrument I play best (including voice) is","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:'docs-Calibri';font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;\">39. The instrument I play best (including voice) is <br><\/span>","DataExportTag":"Q41.GMSI","QuestionID":"QID114"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID115","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for completing the survey. In the next survey, a number of statements will be presented...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>Thank you for completing the survey. In the next survey, a number of <\/span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>statements will be presented to you. Please answer each item true or false.&nbsp; Please do not skip any items.&nbsp; It is important that you answer every item, even if you are not quite certain which is the best answer.&nbsp; An occasional item may refer to experiences that you have had only when taking drugs.&nbsp; Unless you have had the experience at other times (when not under the influence of drugs), mark it as if you have not had that experience.<\/span><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>Some items may sound like others, but all of them are slightly different.&nbsp; Answer each item individually, and don't worry about how you answered a somewhat similar previous item.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>For example, the statement may read, \"<\/span><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;'>The beauty of sunsets is greatly overrated.\" You would then mark \"True\" if you believe sunsets are overrated or \"False\" if you believe sunsets are not overrated. <\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for completing the survey. In the next survey, a number of statements will be presented...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>Thank you for completing the survey. In the next survey, a number of <\/span><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>statements will be presented to you. Please answer each item true or false.&nbsp; Please do not skip any items.&nbsp; It is important that you answer every item, even if you are not quite certain which is the best answer.&nbsp; An occasional item may refer to experiences that you have had only when taking drugs.&nbsp; Unless you have had the experience at other times (when not under the influence of drugs), mark it as if you have not had that experience.<\/span><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>Some items may sound like others, but all of them are slightly different.&nbsp; Answer each item individually, and don't worry about how you answered a somewhat similar previous item.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;'>For example, the statement may read, \"<\/span><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;'>The beauty of sunsets is greatly overrated.\" You would then mark \"True\" if you believe sunsets are overrated or \"False\" if you believe sunsets are not overrated. <\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q1","QuestionID":"QID115"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID116","SecondaryAttribute":"I have usually found lovemaking to be intensely pleasurable.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-416a8311-7fff-1239-43db-a1a86b139ff8\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">I have usually found lovemaking to be intensely pleasurable.<\/span><\/p><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/div><\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"I have usually found lovemaking to be intensely pleasurable.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"True"},"2":{"Display":"False"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-416a8311-7fff-1239-43db-a1a86b139ff8\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transpar