Familarity"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"Labels":[],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID449"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID45","SecondaryAttribute":"The experiment will unfold in three phases:\u00a0 Phase 1: Pre-test: you will hear a melody followed b..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"The experiment will unfold in three phases:&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Phase 1: Pre-test: you will hear a melody followed by a tone, and you will be asked to rate how well the tone fits the preceding melody. This will happen 13 times. The whole phase should last around 2 minutes.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Phase 2: Exposure: you will be listening to music from an alternate musical system, e.g \"music on Mars\". This music will go on for 30 minutes. You may do your own work during this time, but you may not use your headphones, or talk, or listen to anything other than the music from our study.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Phase 3: Post-test: This will be exactly the same as Phase 1: you will rate how well each tone fits the preceding melody, again lasting around 2 minutes.<\/div><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q45","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The experiment will unfold in three phases:\u00a0 Phase 1: Pre-test: you will hear a melody followed b...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID45"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID450","SecondaryAttribute":"What is your song choice #3? ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What is your song choice #3?&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q3.song","QuestionTyp