 the effect of background music on your performance in daily activities of a \u201ccognitive nature\u201d (e.g., studying, memorizing, reading, writing).\nReferring to the scale below, please respond to the following statements by selecting the corresponding number, where 1\u202f=\u202fStrongly disagree and 7\u202f=\u202fStrongly agree.\nMake sure to respond to all statements as accurately as possible.\nBackground music refers to listening to music as a secondary activity while you perform a primary task (e.g., listening to music while reading).<br><br>1\u202f=\u202fStrongly disagree\t2\u202f=\u202fDisagree\t3\u202f=\u202fSlightly disagree\t4\u202f=\u202fNeutral\t5\u202f=\u202fSlightly agree\t6\u202f=\u202fAgree\t7\u202f=\u202fStrongly agree<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q0.musicandemotions","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"This part of the survey aims to explore the effect of background music on your performance in dai...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID455"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID456","SecondaryAttribute":"1. Background music allows me to concentrate better.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"1. Background music allows me to concentrate better.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q1.musicandemotions","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"1. Background music allows me to concentrate better.","Choices":{"8":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"9":{"Display":"Disagree"},"10":{"Display":"Slightly disagree"},"11":{"Display":"Neutral"},"12":{"Display":"Slightly agree"},"13":{"Display":"Agree"},"14":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":["8","9","10","11","12","13","14"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":15,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID456","RecodeValues":{"8":"1","9":"2","10":"3","11":"4","12":"5","13":"6","14":"7"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID457","SecondaryAttribute":"2. Background music helps to make me more alert.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"2. Background music helps to make me more alert.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q2.musicandemotions","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"2. Background music helps to make me more alert.","Choices":{"8":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"9":{"Display":"Disagree"},"10":{"Display":"Slightly disagree"},"11":{"Display":"Neutral"},"12":{"Display":"Slightly agree"},"13":{"Display":"Agree"},"14":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":["8","9","10","11","12","13","14"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":15,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID457","RecodeValues":{"8":"1","9":"2","10":"3","11":"4","12":"5","13":"6","14":"7"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID458","SecondaryAttribute":"3. Background music brings me a sense of joy.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"3. Background music brings me a sense of joy.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q3.musicandemotions","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"3. Background music brin