ther agree nor disagree;<\/span>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5 =&nbsp;Agree;&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6 <span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;72&quot;,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; float: none; -ms-user-select: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">= Strongly agree.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> 7 = Completely agree.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For this survey, each item of this questionnaire is a statement that a person may either agree wi...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">For this survey, each item of this questionnaire is a statement that a person may either agree with or disagree with. For each item, indicate how much you agree or disagree with what the item says.<\/span><br><\/p><p>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please respond to all the items; do not leave any blank. Choose only one response to each statement. Please be as accurate and honest as you can be. Respond to each item as if it were the only item. That is, do not worry about being consistent in your responses.&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Choose from completely disagree (left) to completely agree (right) one of the seven options:<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1 = Completely disagree;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 = Strongly disagree;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 =&nbsp;Disagree;<\/span><\/div>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4 = Neither agree nor disagree;<\/span>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5 =&nbsp;Agree;&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6 <span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;72&quot;,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; float: none; -ms-user-select: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">= Strongly agree.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> 7 = Completely agree.<\/span>","DataExportTag":"Q1","QuestionID":"QID74"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_e8J0joaICCrJgdE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID75","SecondaryAttribute":"1. I spend a lot of my free time doing music-related activities.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-size:15px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:'docs-Calibri';font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;\">1. I spend a lot of my free time doing music-related activities.<\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Bipolar","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"1. I spend a lot of my free time doing music-related activities.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Completely Disagree:Completely Agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":20,"Answers":{"8":{"Display":"8"},"14":{"Display":"14"},"15":{"Display"